% composition-bridge: Hear how a repeating foundation supports delicate variation and a long melodic line.
% composition-context: Toumani Diabaté's kora playing connects with hereditary jeli practice and contemporary concert collaboration in Mali. This new barred-instrument song is not a kora piece.
% composition-distance: Original tune, lyric and chord-free bordun; no kora pattern or "Jarabi" melody is transcribed.
